     2734           round( ( ACCUM TOTAL sj-adv.discnt-sum ) /
     2735                       ( ACCUM TOTAL sj-adv.brutto-sum ) * 100 , 1 ) ELSE 0) @ pcnt
     2736           ACCUM TOTAL sj-adv.netto-sum @ sj-adv.netto-sum
     2737               with FRAME sj-base-d-t .
