     5996     end.
     5997     else do:
     5998                               DOWN STREAM PrnLibStream 1 with FRAME sj-base-d-t .
     5999     end.
     6000   end.
     6001                   if first-of( sj-goods.obj-attr ) AND ( ObjsQnty > 1 ) then  do:
